        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/v/bbe5ce/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-14T16:13:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Wouldn't an overlay/underlay that gave a reference system be a better plan? For the most part, the numbers would clutter the board for people who were playing in real-life. Maybe pdf versions of the scenario maps with numbers on them so people could look at them on electronic devices?</p>",
